=== VALIDACION DE AISLAMIENTO (Server 1, container_vlan100) ===

$ sudo docker exec container_vlan100 ping -c2 192.168.0.1
PING 192.168.0.1 (192.168.0.1): 56 data bytes
64 bytes from 192.168.0.1: seq=0 ttl=64 time=4.482 ms
64 bytes from 192.168.0.1: seq=1 ttl=64 time=0.702 ms
--- 192.168.0.1 ping statistics ---
2 packets transmitted, 2 packets received, 0% packet loss
(gateway alcanzable, esperado)

$ sudo docker exec container_vlan100 ping -c2 -W2 8.8.8.8
PING 8.8.8.8 (8.8.8.8): 56 data bytes
--- 8.8.8.8 ping statistics ---
2 packets transmitted, 0 packets received, 100% packet loss
(sin salida a Internet, esperado)

$ sudo docker exec container_vlan100 ping -c2 -W2 192.168.2.11
PING 192.168.2.11 (192.168.2.11): 56 data bytes
--- 192.168.2.11 ping statistics ---
2 packets transmitted, 0 packets received, 100% packet loss
(sin ruteo entre VLANs, esperado - redes aisladas entre si)

RESULTADO: aislamiento correcto. Gateway alcanzable, Internet bloqueado,
comunicacion entre VLAN100 y VLAN200 bloqueada. Actividad 3 validada end-to-end.
